1
00:00:00,177 --> 00:00:01,217
(Penny:)Here's the difference.

2
00:00:01,387 --> 00:00:04,177
(Penny:)The possibility exists
Leonard could have a birthday party...

3
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:06,478
(Penny:)...before hell freezes over.

4
00:00:08,185 --> 00:00:11,025
(Howard:)Fine. If I do have a threesome,
you can't be part of it.

5
00:00:12,856 --> 00:00:14,526
(Howard:)I'm just kidding. Yes, you can.

6
00:00:15,776 --> 00:00:17,656
(Howard:)Can you bring a friend?

7
00:00:19,363 --> 00:00:21,743
(Sheldon:)I think a birthday party is a terrible idea.

8
00:00:21,907 --> 00:00:24,657
(Sheldon:)I envy Leonard for growing up
without that anguish.

9
00:00:24,827 --> 00:00:25,867
(Penny:)Anguish?

10
00:00:26,036 --> 00:00:29,126
(Sheldon:)Year after year,
I had to endure wearing conical hats...

11
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:32,630
(Sheldon:)...while being forced into the crowded,
sweaty hell of bouncy castles.

12
00:00:32,793 --> 00:00:34,423
(Sheldon:)Not to mention being blindfolded...

13
00:00:34,586 --> 00:00:36,876
(Sheldon:)...and spun toward
a grotesque tailless donkey...

14
00:00:37,047 --> 00:00:40,087
(Sheldon:)...as the other children mocked
my disorientation.

15
00:00:40,884 --> 00:00:45,184
(Penny:)Okay, sweetie, I understand you have scars
that no non-professional can heal...

16
00:00:45,347 --> 00:00:48,227
...but nevertheless, we're gonna
throw Leonard a birthday party.

17
00:00:48,392 --> 00:00:50,432
I'm extremely uncomfortable
with dancing...

18
00:00:50,602 --> 00:00:53,852
(Sheldon:)...loud music and most other forms
of alcohol-induced frivolity.

19
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:57,029
(Penny:)- Nevertheless...
- In addition...

